OL,3,GNEWSAMore staff needed for increased
OL,4,Achildcare hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FIncreased funding for childcare will
OL,7,Fonly be beneficial if more
OL,8,F"appropriately qualified staff" and
OL,9,Fplaces are available, an association
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FJersey's government released its budget
OL,13,Ffor 2027 to 2030 on Tuesday - with a
OL,14,Fnumber of targeted measures designed to
OL,15,Fhelp families with the cost of living.
OL,17,FIt proposed increasing free nursery
OL,18,Fhours for two and three year olds from
OL,19,F15 hours to 20 hours and giving
OL,20,Ffamilies who earn #80,000 or less a
OL,21,Ffamily support payment of #250 for
OL,22,Fevery school age child.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
