OL,3,GNEWSAMore staff needed for increased
OL,4,Achildcare hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FChair of the Jersey Early Years
OL,7,FAssociation (JEYA) Belinda Lewis said
OL,8,Fthere was no prior consultation with it
OL,9,Fregarding the additional #1.7m in
OL,10,Ffunding for the current operation.
